 :org/type :secular-community
 :org/scope :global
 :org/region-primary :region-europe
 :org/founding-date 2016
 :org/instance-count-estimate 9000
 :org/member-count-basis "source-pinned (secondary): ~10M registered Mastodon accounts as of summer 2025, but fewer than 690,000 Mastodon monthly active users by 2025-10 (PLOS research), against an ActivityPub-fediverse-wide plateau of roughly 2-3M MAU excluding Threads. Instance distribution is heavily skewed — a few large servers hold most accounts, the long tail has dozens to hundreds each. No single dashboard publishes an authoritative figure because the network is federated; every number here is one project's measurement, so :org/member-count is not asserted."
 :org/legal-registration :mostly-unregistered
 :org/source-name "Fediverse statistics compilations (Fediview 2026 roundup, PLOS research on Mastodon MAU)"
 :org/source-url "https://fediview.com/articles/fediverse-in-numbers-mastodon-stats-2026/"
 :org/source-date "2025-10"
 :org/source-tier :secondary
 :org/pinned-on "2026-07-25"
 :org/governance-model :consensus
 :org/mission-statement "Federated servers each with its own admin, rules and defederation policy — community governance as a per-instance sovereign act."
 :org/data-provenance "source-pinned"
 :source/dataset "community-coverage"}

{:org/id :org-global-daos
 :org/form-family :family-platform-native
 :org/name "DAOs (decentralized autonomous organizations)"
 :org/entity-kind :org-form
 :org/category :cat-online
 :org/type :secular-community
 :org/scope :global
 :org/region-primary :region-north-america
 :org/founding-date 2016
 :org/instance-count-estimate 13000
 :org/member-count 6500000
 :org/member-count-basis "source-pinned (secondary): ~13,000-14,000 DAOs tracked across chains with ~6.5M governance-token holders in 2025, total treasuries ~$24.5B ($21.4B liquid). The distribution is the real finding: only ~220 DAOs hold treasuries above $1M and fewer than 80 run governance an institutional observer would call healthy, with active participation generally under 20% of holders. Iteration 1's recalled 10M holders overstated by ~1.5x."
 :org/legal-registration :mostly-unregistered
 :org/source-name "DeepDAO ecosystem data as reported by DAO Times / DAO statistics reviews (2025-2026)"
 :org/source-url "https://daotimes.com/deepdao-dao-tool-report-for-2025/"
 :org/source-date "2025"
 :org/source-tier :secondary
 :org/source-caveat "DeepDAO's own dashboard is the primary source; these figures come through summaries and vary by chain-coverage definition."
 :org/pinned-on "2026-07-25"
 :org/registration-note "A minority use Wyoming DAO LLC, Marshall Islands or Swiss association wrappers; most have no legal personality, which is a live liability question."
 :org/governance-model :democratic
 :org/mission-statement "Token- or share-weighted on-chain governance over a shared treasury; the only community form in this corpus whose votes and funds are natively machine-readable."
 :org/coverage-note "Directly comparable to the fleet's own signed-quorum governance (manifest/fleet-keys.edn, ADR-2607160005) — worth a structured comparison in a later iteration."
 :org/data-provenance "source-pinned"
 :source/dataset "community-coverage"}

